Z||000004||Slammed Fiero||09-25-2001||11:21 PM||||16's minimum. I have heard that some 16's require that you grind the caliper flashing a bit to clear the wheel.<P>I ordered my Balancer tonight from Summit racing. $39.00 , I'm going to mount it in the interior. Why?? Some events are run on concrete airstrips , some on corse pavement, and some on smooth ashpalt. I can use my first run to determine whatdegree of braking I want for the specific venue.<P>JM||||reg||1
