Z||000007||HarryG||09-26-2001||03:38 PM||||Ask your CarQuest guy if he has a copy of their Brakes Illustrated Guide (1994). If he does, you can find a wealth of info in it.<P>Ask about these numbers:<P>E104468  (1-1/8 x 40mm, 87-91 Blazer)<P>E150124  (1-1/8 x 40mm, 95-2000 Chev trk C10)<P>Don't know whether these are aluminum.<BR>Also, Raybestos has an on-line catalog which might help. ||||reg||1
